<main class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Your information</div><h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="notice"><strong>Status:</strong> Updated 21 November 2026 to reflect Google AdSense site verification, advertising disclosures and the existing analytics and feedback services. Advertising placements are not currently enabled.</p>
<h2>What information is processed</h2>
<p>EvonyMasters currently offers public tools without requiring you to create an account on this site. When you browse, the hosting and security providers may process technical request information such as IP address, browser and device information, timestamps and requested pages to serve the website and protect it from abuse.</p>
<p>Search terms, filters and tool inputs are sent to EvonyMasters' reward-search or calendar services when you use tools that need current data. This information is used to respond to the request. We do not ask for your Evony login credentials.</p>
<h2>Hosting and service providers</h2>
<p>The website is hosted using Cloudflare, and its live reward and calendar requests use Cloudflare Workers. Cloudflare may handle technical request data as described in its <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">privacy policy</a>. External links, where provided, may take you to third-party services governed by their own privacy practices.</p>
<h2>Cookies, analytics and advertising</h2>
<p><strong>Cloudflare Web Analytics is enabled on this website.</strong> Its measurement script helps us understand aggregate page views, visits, referring sites and website performance so we can improve EvonyMasters. Cloudflare describes Web Analytics as privacy-focused and not using cookies or tracking individual visitors. Requests to the analytics service may still involve technical network information. See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare Web Analytics</a> and <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare's privacy policy</a> for further information. Cloudflare hosting and security features may separately process technical information or use security-related storage.</p>
<p><strong>Google AdSense verification code is installed.</strong> EvonyMasters has included Google's AdSense script to verify the website and apply for approval. Our AdSense application is not approved, and we are not currently displaying AdSense ad placements. The script may contact Google services when a page loads, potentially transmitting technical information such as an IP address, browser details and page request information. Google Analytics is not installed as a separate analytics service in the website source.</p>
<p><strong>Advertising cookies and similar technologies.</strong> If advertising is enabled after approval, Google and other third-party advertising vendors may place or read cookies, use web beacons or process IP addresses and other identifiers to serve and measure ads. Vendors, including Google, may use cookies to show ads based on visitors' earlier visits to this website or other websites. Google's advertising cookies enable Google and its partners to serve personalized advertisements, where permitted. Visitors can manage personalized ads in <a href="https://myadcenter.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google My Ad Center and Ads settings</a> or explore third-party opt-out options at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AboutAds.info</a>.</p>
<p>Before advertising is activated, we will review the enabled advertising partners and applicable consent requirements. Where required, including for certain visitors in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom and Switzerland, we will use an appropriate consent management solution and provide the required choices. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">How Google uses information for advertising</a> for more details.</p>
<h2>Feedback and external sites</h2>
<p>You can send feedback, privacy questions or correction requests to <a href="mailto:contact@evonymasters.com">contact@evonymasters.com</a>. Email is forwarded to a private inbox and used to respond to enquiries or review reported issues. Please do not send passwords or sensitive account information. Third-party links are subject to those sites’ own privacy practices.</p>
<p>When the secure feedback form is enabled, your message, optional player name and reply email, and up to five attachments will be processed by a separate Cloudflare Worker, which checks submissions using Cloudflare Turnstile. Authorized submissions are sent to a private Google Apps Script endpoint operated by EvonyMasters. Google Sheets stores submission details, Google Drive privately stores attachments, and Gmail sends an email notification to our team. We use the information to review reports, improve tools and respond when a reply address is supplied, not for marketing. The Google Apps Script administrator will configure a daily process to delete feedback entries after 90 days and move related attachments to Google Drive trash; final removal from trash follows Google’s retention process. Never submit passwords, account credentials, identity documents or other sensitive personal information. Access to the Sheet, Drive folder and notifications is restricted to authorized administrators. You may request deletion by contacting <a href="mailto:contact@evonymasters.com">contact@evonymasters.com</a>.</p>
<h2>Data requests and questions</h2>
<p>For privacy questions, data-related requests or website feedback, email <a href="mailto:contact@evonymasters.com">contact@evonymasters.com</a>.</p>
<h2>Updates</h2><p>We may revise this page when site features, service providers or privacy requirements change. The date shown at the top identifies the current published version.</p>
